{"id": "1673-143397-0019", "text": "THE PAST HE REGRETTED HE WAS DISCONTENTED WITH THE PRESENT AND THE FUTURE HE HAD REASON TO DREAD THE ORIENTAL BISHOPS SUCCESSIVELY DISENGAGED THEIR CAUSE FROM HIS UNPOPULAR NAME AND EACH DAY DECREASED THE NUMBER OF THE SCHISMATICS WHO REVERED NESTORIUS AS THE CONFESSOR OF THE FAITH", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/1673/143397/1673-143397-0019.flac", "audio_sha256": "d24ff2cf91f1a992101841c4f3e96d9904072fd933b3716ce0d8f81a4c245720", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "1673", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 251120, "duration": 15.695}
{"id": "174-50561-0003", "text": "THE WANDERING SINGER APPROACHES THEM WITH HIS LUTE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/174/50561/174-50561-0003.flac", "audio_sha256": "e9297505e740f8196d4903ef38414bfbf8082f06a31af4474ad6446a44992faa", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "174", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 53440, "duration": 3.34}
{"id": "174-84280-0015", "text": "SHE WAS DESTROYED NOT MERELY BY THE UNCONSIDERED UNDISCIPLINED PASSIONS OF HER HUSBAND AND HER LOVER BUT BY THE VAST TRADITION THAT SUSTAINS AND ENFORCES THE SUBJUGATION OF HER SEX", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/174/84280/174-84280-0015.flac", "audio_sha256": "9c044050d125298d54a7186f9771608ad2dc43b5e9605ec8fd6024b0cbb17680", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "174", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 219680, "duration": 13.73}
{"id": "1919-142785-0051", "text": "PUT THE UDDER INTO A STEWPAN WITH SUFFICIENT WATER TO COVER IT LET IT STEW GENTLY TILL QUITE DONE WHEN TAKE IT OUT TO COOL", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/1919/142785/1919-142785-0051.flac", "audio_sha256": "1177aa322fd968741c5279d7ac436c875272cba3ae6720b1a5c375e9400341ea", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "1919", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 148640, "duration": 9.29}
{"id": "2035-147960-0004", "text": "IT WAS ON ONE OF THESE GRAVEL BEDS THAT I MET MY ADVENTURE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/2035/147960/2035-147960-0004.flac", "audio_sha256": "7a0d780be28f78c1dfc79d24537e9119cea4359a4c4258e0ed47e37529926f7b", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "2035", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 66720, "duration": 4.17}
{"id": "2035-147961-0008", "text": "IT SEEMED TO ME THAT HE DESPISED HIM FOR BEING SO SIMPLE AND DOCILE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/2035/147961/2035-147961-0008.flac", "audio_sha256": "f64db01ded0348fda0972cc32622386e0d2d7ccd889ac2a496597d4d7617fd32", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "2035", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 68000, "duration": 4.25}
{"id": "2035-152373-0013", "text": "WHILE THE LIBERATED EXILES REJOICED ON THE PLAIN OF MEATH THE TENT OF THE ABBOT OF IONA WAS PITCHED ON THE RATH OF TARA A FACT WHICH WOULD SEEM TO INDICATE THAT ALREADY IN LITTLE MORE THAN A CENTURY SINCE THE INTERDICT HAD FALLEN ON IT THE EDIFICES WHICH MADE SO FINE A SHOW IN THE DAYS OF PATRICK WERE RUINED AND UNINHABITABLE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/2035/152373/2035-152373-0013.flac", "audio_sha256": "aaa615b41c4e11cf552e2d39cdb06ae733bae2c53cb6ce5fa27a07e9fabb8bb7", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "2035", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 327520, "duration": 20.47}
{"id": "2412-153954-0006", "text": "THEIR EXPRESSION WAS DIVINE AND AS THEY GLANCED AT ME TIMIDLY BUT WITH PARTED LIPS IN GREAT BEWILDERMENT I FORGOT ALL THOUGHTS OF THEIR CONVERSION IN FEELINGS THAT WERE FAR MORE EARTHLY", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/2412/153954/2412-153954-0006.flac", "audio_sha256": "3feac5890500534685cde5eca5835e47d06bb2b7d0923b2ae3a544f2d68e30d1", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "2412", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 163520, "duration": 10.22}
{"id": "2428-83705-0001", "text": "BUT IT IS QUITE PLAIN TO ME THAT ALL THE ARRANGEMENTS FOR MY WEDDING ARE GOING TO BE MADE BY THE SNELLINGS", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/2428/83705/2428-83705-0001.flac", "audio_sha256": "a7cfd2d49bd00d7ade17541a2abf885e295ba9155efcf9e800d65afab9a8c5ca", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "2428", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 109520, "duration": 6.845}
{"id": "251-136532-0018", "text": "WITHOUT QUESTION HE HAD BECOME OVERNIGHT THE MOST WIDELY KNOWN ARCHAEOLOGIST IN HISTORY", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/251/136532/251-136532-0018.flac", "audio_sha256": "ef7975b40540016f4bad0ba5f01638e2313041ba1994d3efb8ad4a7441324b60", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "251", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 110000, "duration": 6.875}
{"id": "251-137823-0000", "text": "I'LL BE GLAD TO TRY SIR HE REPLIED", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/251/137823/251-137823-0000.flac", "audio_sha256": "0d414255c68f617ca56f32d1c3521e6c22686ed92e99559bb903da5aea5be602", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "251", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 54960, "duration": 3.435}
{"id": "2803-161169-0008", "text": "HERE IS SOMETHING DIFFERENT ROUNDED LIKE A NUT SHELL YOU CAN SPLIT OFF ONE SIDE AND BEHOLD THERE IS THE NUT LYING SNUGLY AS DOES ANY CHESTNUT IN ITS BUR", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/2803/161169/2803-161169-0008.flac", "audio_sha256": "a8e6541fe83e19d096cf298811bbd5778c2e7c3c86a2e57efa2374611c829af7", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "2803", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 226240, "duration": 14.14}
{"id": "3000-15664-0027", "text": "THEIR LONG MASSIVE EARS GIVE THEM A VERY STRIKING APPEARANCE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/3000/15664/3000-15664-0027.flac", "audio_sha256": "fc9ee6da5425f794b2e5bf5de50b7c7574ffa9d31917f74a0f7a8cee14c9de8f", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "3000", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 64720, "duration": 4.045}
{"id": "3081-166546-0048", "text": "WELL WELL THAT'S HONEST AT ALL EVENTS", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/3081/166546/3081-166546-0048.flac", "audio_sha256": "30595865552fd32665056354e4e002fc9472e78c9ebbe65d377b14168fe39eee", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "3081", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 76960, "duration": 4.81}
{"id": "3752-4944-0015", "text": "WELL NOW SAID MEEKIN WITH ASPERITY I DON'T AGREE WITH YOU", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/3752/4944/3752-4944-0015.flac", "audio_sha256": "c1b8b0adadf569873ccb5d6c9717fdb5a5849bfcd7c4e5b87db9404fbf2d47f1", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "3752", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 66160, "duration": 4.135}
{"id": "6295-64301-0009", "text": "HE WAS IN A MOOD FOR MUSIC WAS HE NOT", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6295/64301/6295-64301-0009.flac", "audio_sha256": "d0393a23285fe4063666362685c384bfcdb56bfd83ecc5eeb1270268ca634d34", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "6295", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 48080, "duration": 3.005}
{"id": "6345-93302-0004", "text": "AND CURIOUSLY ENOUGH SHE WAS HARDLY CURIOUS AT ALL ABOUT WHAT HE MIGHT HAVE TO SAY", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6345/93302/6345-93302-0004.flac", "audio_sha256": "6286249d34ba7dd1da463bacbe2b1f4f6490750b093abc19276680352dfb9676", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "6345", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 70640, "duration": 4.415}
{"id": "6345-93302-0028", "text": "HE CHECKED THE SILLY IMPULSE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6345/93302/6345-93302-0028.flac", "audio_sha256": "743d713400a50573dae930e5accc5da524d56e9fb48d1fc4771d3eafe6a933bb", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "6345", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 31040, "duration": 1.94}
{"id": "777-126732-0040", "text": "THEY ARE NOURISHING THEIR GREED ON THE QUIVERING FLESH AND THE WARM BLOOD OF THE PEOPLE NOTHING ELSE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/777/126732/777-126732-0040.flac", "audio_sha256": "b18c3bedc9c4f06919959d896de9fbf719934f2339cd010c06b336dc7d592a88", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "777", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 79760, "duration": 4.985}
{"id": "777-126732-0064", "text": "THAT POOR BOY IS IN A VERY EXCITED STATE TO NIGHT SHE MURMURED AFTER A PAUSE WHICH LASTED FOR THREE TICKS OF THE CLOCK", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/777/126732/777-126732-0064.flac", "audio_sha256": "001aff4f8622c8a7ada9a4b573bd710ff7ecab6970ba789025561921a7fd8481", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "777", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 93759, "duration": 5.8599375}
{"id": "7976-110124-0013", "text": "THE TWO ELDEST ATE THEIR APPLES BUT THE YOUNGEST COULD NOT EAT THAT NIGHT SHE THREW THE APPLE AWAY", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/7976/110124/7976-110124-0013.flac", "audio_sha256": "c2dc16808b08d915de18156e2cc69db3596bf4f8a3156a740582f206bc53139a", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "7976", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 104880, "duration": 6.555}
{"id": "8297-275154-0019", "text": "I TRIED IT YESTERDAY IT SET MY BRAINS ON FIRE I'M FEELING THAT GLASS I TOOK JUST NOW", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/8297/275154/8297-275154-0019.flac", "audio_sha256": "6557ca40c916bcc774a5219f9d9f7465b43c0497adaf63e9548b3e0b5c2bb27d", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "8297", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 126080, "duration": 7.88}
{"id": "84-121123-0023", "text": "NOIRTIER WAS NEAR THE BED PALE MOTIONLESS AND SILENT AS THE CORPSE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/84/121123/84-121123-0023.flac", "audio_sha256": "de5ac89fdba6009de9ca8b9cacd6e8d3604c35985d412deb7dc7bb61dc0872c0", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "84", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 74960, "duration": 4.685}
{"id": "8842-302196-0004", "text": "POETRY NOT BEING AN EXACT SCIENCE LITERALITY OF RENDERING IS ALTOGETHER SECONDARY TO THIS CHIEF LAW", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/8842/302196/8842-302196-0004.flac", "audio_sha256": "2ce3543f12ba2033a869fbce7434e74f149722db31ed5e494cad6d1bf9462ae4", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "8842", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 91840, "duration": 5.74}
{"id": "2902-9006-0012", "text": "TRIBE AFTER TRIBE WAS CROWDING DOWN TO THE ALPS AND TRAMPLING UPON EACH OTHER ON THE FRONTIERS OF THE EMPIRE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/2902/9006/2902-9006-0012.flac", "audio_sha256": "45192a4292b6019e3092dc2600b9090bb95fe0c372076f706a87ddb44ccf7a24", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "2902", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 102720, "duration": 6.42}
{"id": "652-130726-0016", "text": "THE FLY TRAP AND CHARLIE'S FASHION THE FIRST IN SUTTER STREET NEAR KEARNY AND THE OTHER IN MARKET NEAR SUTTER SERVE WELL COOKED FOODS ESPECIALLY SOUP SALADS AND FISH", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/652/130726/652-130726-0016.flac", "audio_sha256": "7f0d5975bc207ee2d7f13e39edd607f7d3b9277a70a3fb1b8a45fedaf9925142", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "652", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 166560, "duration": 10.41}
{"id": "5694-64038-0009", "text": "THE VOICE APPEARED TO BE OVERHEAD", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/5694/64038/5694-64038-0009.flac", "audio_sha256": "1ed390325c6bd012a7ce345fc53cb290d12a6cc7bb71b61794eed639ebd962a0", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "5694", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 38160, "duration": 2.385}
{"id": "3081-166546-0077", "text": "MISS CLARKE STARTED AND HER SWEET FACE SHOWED A MOMENT'S PERPLEXITY DID I SHE QUERIED MUSINGLY", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/3081/166546/3081-166546-0077.flac", "audio_sha256": "21d0e66ba6683b1de2ad50b0d45c3efcb7fd541103de3f0284720f72f61d26cd", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "3081", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 166800, "duration": 10.425}
{"id": "2035-147960-0011", "text": "WE DECIDED THAT ANTONIA SHOULD RIDE DUDE HOME AND I WOULD WALK", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/2035/147960/2035-147960-0011.flac", "audio_sha256": "cb8d215dfb1e6207d1dd6e972a3c315882b4302a930d668ae9f0346417a94d88", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "2035", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 70080, "duration": 4.38}
{"id": "5536-43359-0015", "text": "OUR HONOR IS THE GUARANTEE FOR HIS SAFETY SO LONG AS HE IS WITHIN THE CAMP", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/5536/43359/5536-43359-0015.flac", "audio_sha256": "0eb3ca6b3b5f0418b1b7bdc0d11b97a3538b2f0d8e118abe24cb52f82352af4c", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "5536", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 74000, "duration": 4.625}
{"id": "6313-76958-0008", "text": "HUMPH GRUNTED CURLEY ADAMS", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6313/76958/6313-76958-0008.flac", "audio_sha256": "9aa12af5b01852344229a8300b1a88624e22a9051742c248e3d026e91d3b875c", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "6313", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 37520, "duration": 2.345}
{"id": "652-129742-0006", "text": "CAULIFLOWER MAYONNAISE TAKE COLD BOILED CAULIFLOWER BREAK INTO BRANCHES ADDING SALT PEPPER AND VINEGAR TO SEASON", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/652/129742/652-129742-0006.flac", "audio_sha256": "081f8aed018bb8324cf490f95df9efbeab37e002d81b4400a66e3166c4b6c21c", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "652", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 145840, "duration": 9.115}
{"id": "3170-137482-0005", "text": "WE WOULD VERY OFTEN SPEND THE WHOLE NIGHT RAMBLING ABOUT THE CITY INVENTING AND CARRYING INTO EXECUTION THE MOST IMPERTINENT PRACTICAL JOKES", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/3170/137482/3170-137482-0005.flac", "audio_sha256": "84b89d841afc3e6756e9e10794a83157fc0ae6f12cc5b6a40d538b79a00cb135", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "3170", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 139520, "duration": 8.72}
{"id": "2078-142845-0042", "text": "VICTORIA BUNS SEVENTEEN THIRTY TWO", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/2078/142845/2078-142845-0042.flac", "audio_sha256": "c3e269f4257f0ea0b78488472c98c65ae355372a31f9fcf601b8c4f5f42caa3a", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "2078", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 67680, "duration": 4.23}
{"id": "652-130726-0025", "text": "PUT IN THE OVEN AND BROWN TO A GOLDEN COLOR", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/652/130726/652-130726-0025.flac", "audio_sha256": "8f95d73c1992f90b45678cfbbbb26e8afd0ec4553b87d38f3a04a0d5e40700fa", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "652", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 42080, "duration": 2.63}
{"id": "8297-275155-0017", "text": "WHEN HE AND I HAPPENED TO BE LEFT TOGETHER HE NATURALLY WONDERED AFTER HAVING SEEN THE BEAUTIFUL WIFE WHERE THE LUCKY HUSBAND MIGHT BE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/8297/275155/8297-275155-0017.flac", "audio_sha256": "5f31c91f40f018dd590e752c6ccbaab4f2d2cafe9244229675c7c48602b9c87a", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "8297", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 142560, "duration": 8.91}
{"id": "5536-43363-0012", "text": "THIS WAS ONLY ONE OF HIS REMARKABLE PROPHECIES", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/5536/43363/5536-43363-0012.flac", "audio_sha256": "5878d8fb8806d95b381b05d1b9c544f21ab4668f99eeccffb20bf4edee9cb7e9", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "5536", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 52240, "duration": 3.265}
{"id": "3576-138058-0004", "text": "DULCINEA IS PERISHING THOU ART LIVING ON REGARDLESS I AM DYING OF HOPE DEFERRED THEREFORE UNTRUSS THYSELF WITH A GOOD WILL FOR MINE IT IS HERE IN THIS RETIRED SPOT TO GIVE THEE AT LEAST TWO THOUSAND LASHES", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/3576/138058/3576-138058-0004.flac", "audio_sha256": "72f8e00fab6549759c480d14cc01603952f08d2c3ca150a4478b7054f95fe8b1", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "3576", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 264960, "duration": 16.56}
{"id": "8842-302196-0001", "text": "THIS BOOK IN ITS ORIGINAL FORM WAS RECEIVED WITH FAVOUR AND SETTLED THE CLAIM OF ROSSETTI TO RANK AS A POETIC TRANSLATOR OR INDEED AS A POET IN HIS OWN RIGHT", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/8842/302196/8842-302196-0001.flac", "audio_sha256": "2cd03509d9dd0acaa969fc0df956e62e078c1cf6cc6e6383f52cb3438ab0185f", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "8842", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 149600, "duration": 9.35}
{"id": "3081-166546-0075", "text": "YES MANY TIMES", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/3081/166546/3081-166546-0075.flac", "audio_sha256": "2d7344eaf407105044ec7d66ce4d526e3668cb1241d0bb41b3f566024c41355d", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "3081", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 39600, "duration": 2.475}
{"id": "2035-152373-0005", "text": "IT WAS THE SEASON WHEN THE ANCIENT SUN GOD HAD BEEN ACCUSTOMED TO RECEIVE HIS ANNUAL OBLATIONS AND WE CAN WELL BELIEVE THAT THOSE WHOSE HEARTS STILL TREMBLED AT THE NAME OF BEL MUST HAVE CONNECTED THE ECLIPSE AND THE PLAGUE WITH THE REVOLUTION IN THE NATIONAL WORSHIP AND THE OVERTHROW OF THE ANCIENT GODS ON THAT PLAIN OF PROSTRATION WHERE THEY HAD SO LONG RECEIVED THE HOMAGE OF AN ENTIRE PEOPLE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/2035/152373/2035-152373-0005.flac", "audio_sha256": "2678f3763a53fddda4d39fcf946ce2f4304b14f0f26ce2691eb6f16dacf66212", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "2035", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 384480, "duration": 24.03}
{"id": "6241-66616-0019", "text": "THERE WERE TEARS IN THE BOYS EYES WHEN THEY PARTED AND THE MOTHER CRIED FOR THE INDIAN BOY WHO WAS RETURNING TO HIS PEOPLE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6241/66616/6241-66616-0019.flac", "audio_sha256": "afc72bf36c56d5fc30295c782f495dbea947bec1538b04f24c8c64eb7551cf36", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "6241", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 101040, "duration": 6.315}
{"id": "2428-83699-0028", "text": "THERE'S A KNOCKER IF NONE OF EM HAVEN'T TWISTED IT OFF", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/2428/83699/2428-83699-0028.flac", "audio_sha256": "2631b5d8c8fff74aeeb271dcff9251615036379a26bec4abce1eddf3d377fa0f", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "2428", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 64000, "duration": 4.0}
{"id": "6313-76958-0022", "text": "ALMOST BEFORE THE ECHOES OF HIS VOICE HAD DIED AWAY A SHRILL VOICE PIPED UP FROM THE TAIL END OF THE CHUCK WAGON", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6313/76958/6313-76958-0022.flac", "audio_sha256": "b59d5865442b691d30a8d1cfe030d0106343eb746ef8854f7769239023e9aa85", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "6313", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 100720, "duration": 6.295}
{"id": "6319-64726-0002", "text": "THE TURN OF THE OLD FAIRY HAD NOW COME AND SHE DECLARED WHILE HER HEAD SHOOK WITH MALICE THAT THE PRINCESS SHOULD PIERCE HER HAND WITH A SPINDLE AND DIE OF THE WOUND", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6319/64726/6319-64726-0002.flac", "audio_sha256": "08fc4f9436c858ba7ca4690fe8f07844010957f521350fb979670c660931ba5f", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "6319", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 195200, "duration": 12.2}
{"id": "1988-148538-0005", "text": "I DO NOT BELIEVE IN SUCH REPUBLICS ANY MORE THAN IN THAT OF PLATO OR IF THE THINGS WE READ OF REALLY HAPPENED I DO NOT HESITATE TO AFFIRM THAT THESE SUPPOSED DEMOCRACIES WERE COMPOSED OF VERY DIFFERENT ELEMENTS FROM OURS AND THAT THEY HAD NOTHING IN COMMON WITH THE LATTER EXCEPT THEIR NAME", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/1988/148538/1988-148538-0005.flac", "audio_sha256": "ccc930526a17dce4bc5ddbd410daa4b2ab9ccb2901bcb90b62314f3fa778a10b", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "1988", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 261600, "duration": 16.35}
{"id": "1272-128104-0010", "text": "NEAR THE FIRE AND THE ORNAMENTS FRED BROUGHT HOME FROM INDIA ON THE MANTEL BOARD", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/1272/128104/1272-128104-0010.flac", "audio_sha256": "2ebbcaa44f14c15fd8afd0e4a71cae494377d30812a0ba05d6be07c55d00bbea", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "1272", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 89600, "duration": 5.6}
{"id": "3000-15664-0005", "text": "ONE BLANKET WILL BE ENOUGH TO CARRY OR YOU MAY FOREGO THE PLEASURE AND BURDEN ALTOGETHER AS WOOD FOR FIRES IS EVERYWHERE ABUNDANT", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/3000/15664/3000-15664-0005.flac", "audio_sha256": "22ae23cb7d7437d9916911660709a0a2baaf9180562d88f471ceb0ac102b6c2f", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "3000", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 135360, "duration": 8.46}
